the proof of the paranormal.<br><br><strong>You play as Doi, the paranormal enthusiast and would you accept the challenge of investigating the haunted asylum at night?</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144470/extras/02438f9870c8540bbf738f330178620f.poster.avif?t=1724980495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144470/extras/02438f9870c8540bbf738f330178620f.webm?t=1724980495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144470/extras/02438f9870c8540bbf738f330178620f.mp4?t=1724980495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the entire asylum.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Come face to face with the spirits of the patients, shadow people and the demons.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect items like key, hammer, etc.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore morgue and basement area.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Nearly half an hour of paranormal investigation.</li></ul><br><strong><br>Note: I am a solo indie game developer and I have done all of the graphics, artwork, character design, and programming except for the music. I hope you will enjoy the game.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144470/extras/bdd4152610946a41699788ede66fdd8d.poster.avif?t=1724980495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144470/extras/bdd4152610946a41699788ede66fdd8d.webm?t=1724980495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144470/extras/bdd4152610946a41699788ede66fdd8d.mp4?t=1724980495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
